Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.63,0:00:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在海边的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇见一个企图夺取铁碎牙的神秘美女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个深爱着犬夜叉的哥哥杀生丸的女子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背后其实隐藏着十分悲伤的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:29.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:36.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:49.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.09,0:00:55.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:01:01.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:06.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:14.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:19.50,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:28.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:32.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.97,0:01:35.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:40.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:47.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了寻找最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打倒宿敌奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的旅行不断的持续着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我们之外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有另外一个人在追踪奈落的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是犬夜叉的哥哥杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:20.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于杀生丸是真正的妖怪 认为半妖犬夜叉是他们家族的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分的嫌恶他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉跟杀生丸的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是一只以西国为根据地的巨犬妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们父亲过世之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埋在父亲墓中的妖刀铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是引发他们兄弟互相争斗的导火线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然还设下了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.19,0:02:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才明明把杀生丸少爷弹出来的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然让犬夜叉进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我一定会保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙竟然产生脉动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到铁碎牙竟然对坚持要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护我的犬夜叉有了反应
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那一瞬间变化成獠牙之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去了左手的杀生丸还是不死心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好几次企图抢走铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是犬夜叉也不认输
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们明明是亲生的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道因为杀生丸是真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才这么无情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到这世上还有另外一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.21,0:03:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让杀生丸动了心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:37.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深爱杀生丸的女子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到海边的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不喜欢这种咸死人的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很喜欢海边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早知道就把泳装带过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:04:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了 我们可不是来玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔也要好好的放松一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:06.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么偶尔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你一直都是在放松的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有嗅到四魂之玉碎片的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像感觉不到任何的邪气和妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这一带的确是个平静的好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们应该要好好的休个假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 把它捡回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听好 不要把我当狗耍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您一定很痛苦 可怜的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 我并不是什么公主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个很平凡的人 叫我娑罗就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果阿佐野城没有被烧毁的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果您没有生重病的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么可能在这种简陋的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您这样叫我们看了怎么忍心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是所谓的命运的安排吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不好意思 给你们大家添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您怎么这么说呢 娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来就是要侍奉娑罗小姐您
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要这么说的话 我才是幸福的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在你们跟村里的人的围绕之下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望最后能够再为大家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吹一次笛子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 等等我啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗小姐 娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:38.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这世上还有一个心愿未了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.18,0:06:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 你也感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 你们怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很强烈的邪气聚集在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么多的邪气聚集在那个地方就表示
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道会是奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里的确是聚集了不少的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是绝对不是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正跟我们无关
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:23.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是尼姑庵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定出了什么事 我们快去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生了什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗小姐离开人世的那一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发出了耀眼的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是一位居住在这个地方的尼姑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时也是一个时常拿药给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心地善良的大好人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:03.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师他们说耀眼的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许和刚才聚集在这一带的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关联也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是刚才的邪气好像已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在感觉不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗小姐 娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的遗体 您的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:27.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有那个床垫还清楚留着一个人的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有烧焦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里本来躺着娑罗小姐的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到竟然与那道光芒一起消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见爷爷 我们来玩绕口令好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红邪见 青邪见 黄邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.16,0:08:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红邪见 青邪见 黄邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见爷爷 你好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红邪见 青邪见 黄邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷一直在追踪奈落的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是还是半点线索都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种日子到底要持续到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.68,0:09:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见了 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我们杀生丸少爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您好 我叫娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:58.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说谁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在阿佐野城发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您已经忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿佐野城
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗第一次见到杀生丸少爷的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是在阿佐野城 已经摇摇欲坠的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.15,0:10:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,领主
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人很可能计划在今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与我方人马分出胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经坚守了1个月
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兵粮已尽 官兵的士气也十分低落
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事到如今 只好做放弃城池的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抢回最后的一线生机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 仔细听好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:49.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来放火烧城 放下城门冲出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,属下实在不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最起码让我们报一箭之仇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 绝对不能再战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让自己活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,领主 领主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,领主 好像有人攻进了敌人的阵营
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奇迹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是天助我也
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快点来看看那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一个人单枪匹马攻进敌营
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底击倒了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:14.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗全心全意想要达成杀生丸少爷您心中的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要达成我的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且当那个愿望达成的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望您能接受娑罗对您的这份心意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是在说什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样的姑娘家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能达成杀生丸少爷的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我退下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗一定会达成杀生丸少爷的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 那个姑娘到底是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 全都靠化妆的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个普通的人类姑娘能做得了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成你瞎了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位姑娘根本不是人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:28.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 如果说原本是人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在她的模样就是半人半鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那座尼姑庵的爆炸到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:44.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说邪气集中起来有的时候会产生爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听过这样的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.59,0:13:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个叫娑罗的尼姑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗体突然不见的这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:57.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在是百思不解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这其中到底有什么关联呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像有一种很不好的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算真是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事跟我们要办的事一点关系都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是不要淌这滩浑水会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女孩子是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子那个怪物的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是岸上的那个女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上来救你 小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:44.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师你的动机也未免太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:56.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们这些人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管有几条命都不够赔的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么坐上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说了 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 快上来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:22.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 那位姑娘交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来用风穴对付这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:00.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们触怒了海神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是刚才那只怪物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的心脏还在跳动 她应该还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要怎么样才能够救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把那只怪物消灭掉就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消灭掉海神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么海神啊 管他那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪门子的海神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海草
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行啊 他们没有恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没有恢复原状呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.65,0:17:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好像是玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,衣服跟飞来骨也都凝固起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么无法恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:16.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是因为海神大人的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:18.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并没有解除的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们赶来救我 我真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:23.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来应该这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:29.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们根本就不应该来这里救我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问你为什么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,详细的情况等一下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里很快就要涨潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心你们的同伴会被海浪卷走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:42.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须快点带他们离开这里才行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要把他们搬到我居住的村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.12,0:17:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:52.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫海猫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会被绑在那么危险的地方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.53,0:17:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是这一次献给海神的活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:17:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这片海几乎每四年在这个时期
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会发生很大的海难
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我们村子有个习俗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是把人当作活祭品奉献给这片海的海神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然受到了天谴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们打倒了海神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以大家也都凝固了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.56,0:18:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:30.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有报应的话 就报到我一个人身上好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道没有让大家恢复原状的方法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果摧毁海神大人的祠堂 也许可以
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说海神的祠堂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那你立刻带我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前这个地方住着一个叫阿佐野的领主
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那个悬崖上有一座很雄伟的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个祠堂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把竖立的1字横过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个祠堂就会崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整座岩场也会沉入海底
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:14.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:17.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这里毁掉就可以了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不瞒你们说 我们村里的人曾经试过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:24.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 就算是五个大男人的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.25,0:19:25.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也丝毫动不了它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:27.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就来试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不动耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空手是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:41.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要借助什么工具的力量才行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用工具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,例如您现在腰上的那把刀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.51,0:19:50.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的动了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我觉得这个女的 好像有点可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先回想一下弥勒他们被凝固的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的脸好像都朝着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个被绑的姑娘的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是遭到海神的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸应该是朝向海的方向对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那个女的 看犬夜叉搬动大石头时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会不会是什么陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:44.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让弥勒他们变成那个样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定不是海神 而是眼前的这个女的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.47,0:20:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.89,0:21:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:23.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海猫姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海草
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟海神是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来海猫姑娘跟海神都只是被操纵的傀儡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 铁碎牙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.67,0:21:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在祠堂里面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.93,0:22:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把铁碎牙给我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把铁碎牙已经在我的手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.35,0:22:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙被抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来她的目的是铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有什么状况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您怎么在这
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您怎么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.77,0:23:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事果然是你暗中指使的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:27.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 您只要压制住犬夜叉就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.77,0:23:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要乱叫 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.47,0:23:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她的事根本与你无关
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.11,0:23:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女的 不是跟杀生丸同伙的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.38,0:23:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来好像不是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.78,0:24:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把铁碎牙给您
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用它让可恨的犬夜叉成为刀下亡魂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.85,0:24:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.79,0:24:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的以为这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我杀生丸心里的愿望吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.06,0:24:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的意思难道不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.13,0:24:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要打倒犬夜叉非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.37,0:24:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着借用你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.47,0:24:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.11,0:24:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 把铁碎牙还来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.82,0:24:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也会变成玻璃的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.73,0:24:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.58,0:25:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.18,0:25:07.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.58,0:25:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 不能让她逃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.15,0:25:11.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要去追吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.89,0:25:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们两个先去看看弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.95,0:25:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有珊瑚的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然犬夜叉已经变回了原来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.16,0:25:23.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒跟村里的那些人 说不定也变回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.53,0:25:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你一个人没有问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话 当然没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:29.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 我一定要抢回我的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.69,0:25:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.20,0:26:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 原来是那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.07,0:26:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.37,0:26:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底能不能发挥铁碎牙的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.34,0:26:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要睁大眼睛看清楚你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.02,0:26:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.24,0:26:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.05,0:26:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碍眼的家伙 闪一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.61,0:26:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 这家伙好像受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.95,0:26:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着怕他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.25,0:26:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在阿佐野双树前 拿这个家伙来血祭
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.13,0:27:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群小虫子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.87,0:27:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.04,0:27:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.81,0:27:15.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.13,0:27:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:49.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把铁碎牙给我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.01,0:27:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 我找你找得好辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:27:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.39,0:28:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个臭犬夜叉 真是可恨到极点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.82,0:28:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不但抢走了铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还夺走了杀生丸少爷您的左手
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.40,0:28:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.86,0:28:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来这位英雄的名字叫做杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您回想起来了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.35,0:28:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.35,0:28:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您就躺在那棵树下静静地休息
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.09,0:28:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我直到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.39,0:28:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是无法忘记那个时候的情景
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.86,0:28:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在我眼中这个世上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也没有人比你长的更俊美了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就这样一直注视着您
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一天 我为了杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.74,0:28:56.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在野外采花吹笛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就已经感到无比的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.42,0:29:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个妖怪还待在那个地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.35,0:29:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 他还是保持那样不动
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.09,0:29:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那娑罗在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗公主 每天都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.66,0:29:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会去那个地方看那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.13,0:29:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 立刻召集士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.03,0:29:23.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去斩妖除魔
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,领主
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可以让自己心爱的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一个妖怪夺走了心思
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.87,0:29:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事会成为我们阿佐野家到末代最大的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.44,0:29:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要趁早解决掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下 父亲大人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.16,0:29:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道您忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.23,0:29:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷是保护我们阿佐野城的大恩人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.96,0:29:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让开 娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:29:59.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲当时的作为是不可原谅的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.87,0:30:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我怎么赔罪都弥补不了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.14,0:30:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笛子的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.81,0:30:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.11,0:30:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像一直听到了笛子的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.15,0:30:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个笛子的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:28.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.15,0:30:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.22,0:30:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们原来好像是在海边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.69,0:30:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,详细的情形待会儿再跟你们说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.15,0:30:41.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在要紧的是先去追犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.21,0:31:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.31,0:31:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个妖怪 觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.45,0:31:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.39,0:31:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.22,0:31:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你退开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.16,0:31:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.82,0:31:16.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你退开
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.33,0:31:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.99,0:31:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁枪队 向前准备
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.27,0:31:31.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.35,0:31:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 铁枪队 开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.09,0:31:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.02,0:31:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.99,0:31:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁枪队被…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.40,0:31:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是…你这可恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.38,0:32:09.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.61,0:32:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们以为与杀生丸少爷为敌
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.28,0:32:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后还能够全身而退吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.38,0:32:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撤退 撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.39,0:32:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.62,0:32:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看接下来就交给小的来处理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.39,0:32:22.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再追了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.13,0:32:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的笛声
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笛声好像停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来过了不久之后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.33,0:32:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿佐野城就陷入了火海之中
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放火的人就是我的父亲 阿佐野双树
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.14,0:32:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我父亲太恐惧杀生丸少爷的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.98,0:32:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他无法释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.41,0:32:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去理智濒临崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.32,0:32:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后选择了与阿佐野城同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而我对杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.56,0:32:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却没有任何一点的怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.46,0:33:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为归根究底
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.86,0:33:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能怪我父亲自己失去了理智
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.13,0:33:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我后来步入佛门 成为尼姑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我死去的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.17,0:33:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及城中的人的灵魂 祝祷祈福
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:16.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是也许是报应 也许是因果吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.68,0:33:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久之后 我也得到了传染病
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心里很清楚将不久于人世
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:27.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是隐藏着自己对杀生丸少爷的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.66,0:33:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来打算就这样告别今生的缘分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.59,0:33:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到 犬夜叉在那一刻出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:40.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到犬夜叉的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.37,0:33:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就立刻改变了心意
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.14,0:33:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能够 再让我活久一点的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:49.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会立刻拔刀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱着同归于尽的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.05,0:33:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从犬夜叉手中夺走铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.48,0:33:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是我唯一能为父亲犯下的错
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.49,0:34:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所做的一点弥补
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.06,0:34:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.07,0:34:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无数的魑魅魍魉出现在我的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.31,0:34:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道大家都看不见他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.68,0:34:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.01,0:34:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以帮你实现未完成的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你拥有的灵力成为我们的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.22,0:34:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的肉体奉献给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.56,0:34:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以杀了犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.43,0:34:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且夺走他手上的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.03,0:34:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.73,0:34:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想把自己的心意传达给杀生丸知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.11,0:34:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俊美的杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我没有任何的犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.22,0:35:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里的妖怪们 也毫不迟疑地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.42,0:35:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.42,0:35:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说它们很兴奋的占据我的心灵跟身体
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我得到充沛的灵力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.68,0:35:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底自由的心灵与身体
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那一刻开始 我得到了重生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.48,0:35:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.45,0:35:56.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您一定要接受娑罗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.55,0:35:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全心全意为您付出的这份心意
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.72,0:36:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.66,0:36:04.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.79,0:36:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道您在说什么 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.73,0:36:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.84,0:36:15.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错 你要插手是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.44,0:36:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.61,0:36:25.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不准你动她
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.62,0:36:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这件事跟你毫无关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.35,0:36:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.65,0:36:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何我都要抢回我的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.42,0:36:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.76,0:36:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.57,0:36:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你不得好死
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.57,0:36:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好不要再在我杀生丸的面前
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.31,0:36:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露出狰狞的面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.68,0:36:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:36:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了 犬夜叉在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.78,0:37:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下去吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他们好像在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.72,0:37:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸跟那个女的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.75,0:37:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.76,0:37:12.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然识破了我们的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我看不出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.21,0:37:26.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好眼力 看穿了这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.68,0:37:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.31,0:37:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娑罗只不过是个媒介罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的真正目的是杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.32,0:37:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要打倒了犬夜叉 抢到铁碎牙作为诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.36,0:37:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会自动出现自投罗网
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.00,0:37:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切果然按照我们的计划进行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.27,0:37:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然有这么多妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.80,0:37:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.34,0:37:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.65,0:38:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.85,0:38:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 不要连铁碎牙都吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.32,0:38:16.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.64,0:38:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉 那支笛子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.11,0:38:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是发生爆炸的那间尼姑庵里面尼姑的笛子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.51,0:38:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢 那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.41,0:38:40.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人说不定就是那个时候的那位尼姑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.42,0:38:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在变成了妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说 妖怪附身在那个尼姑身上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.79,0:38:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.76,0:38:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要彻底消灭它们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.30,0:38:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人的灵力已经化成了我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.87,0:39:00.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且只要再吸收你的妖力的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能成为这世上最强的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.81,0:39:04.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一堆垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.41,0:39:08.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.61,0:39:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅…请原谅我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.62,0:39:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道她还没有完全被妖怪控制住
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.65,0:39:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你的嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.95,0:39:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在只是属于我的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.46,0:39:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不但失去了自己的意识
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.63,0:39:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时也无法动弹 求生不得求死不能
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.56,0:39:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我当时太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.63,0:39:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会给杀生丸少爷添麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.47,0:39:33.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫你闭嘴听到了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.94,0:39:39.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.45,0:39:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.41,0:39:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让娑罗跟这群妖怪一起同归于尽
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.82,0:39:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把剑上凝聚了仇恨与憎恨的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.86,0:39:59.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的血对于我们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.79,0:40:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更是最好的养份
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.70,0:40:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你用尽了力量 也绝对不可能消灭我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.98,0:40:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.65,0:40:21.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.22,0:40:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我想要救那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.72,0:40:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定 我的破魔之箭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.99,0:40:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以净化这一群妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射中
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.60,0:40:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.03,0:40:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 敌人变得更多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.90,0:40:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是再这么下去 那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能用斗鬼神的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就只好用这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.95,0:40:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.25,0:40:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他竟然拔起了铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:41:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一挥就能消灭掉上百只妖怪的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.52,0:41:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借用一下你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.98,0:41:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.55,0:41:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.70,0:41:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙终于回到我手上了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.30,0:41:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你见识一下 我发挥铁碎牙的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.94,0:41:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.04,0:41:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.14,0:41:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.24,0:41:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.58,0:41:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.64,0:42:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于解脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.61,0:42:27.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激您
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在我仍没有后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.79,0:42:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.19,0:42:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于能把自己的心意传达出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.06,0:42:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让您了解我对您的心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.25,0:43:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续在那个世界吹笛子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.66,0:43:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.16,0:43:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位姑娘真是个可怜的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.09,0:43:22.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 她现在一定能够安息了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.23,0:43:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女的能够得到救赎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.17,0:43:27.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.67,0:43:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从她最后安详的面容就看得出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.11,0:43:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀生丸他救了那位娑罗小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.94,0:43:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸那家伙怎么可能救别人哪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.95,0:43:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙永远像一阵风来无影去无踪的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.88,0:43:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.43,0:43:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷又跑到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.03,0:43:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.03,0:44:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.00,0:44:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您到底去了什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.77,0:44:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.14,0:44:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没去什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.14,0:44:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就去了那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.21,0:44:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.82,0:44:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.45,0:44:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.98,0:44:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.82,0:44:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.04,0:44:41.76,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.31,0:44:57.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.82,0:45:03.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.91,0:45:07.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.41,0:45:13.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.92,0:45:23.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.89,0:45:31.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.90,0:45:34.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.40,0:45:39.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.65,0:45:46.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.52,0:46:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿八 你说什么 梦心师父快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.59,0:46:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 真的很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.75,0:46:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.42,0:46:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦心师父不就是抚养弥勒法师长大的老和尚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.42,0:46:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是谁总有一天都会死掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.69,0:46:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么愁眉苦脸也是没办法的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.13,0:46:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.96,0:46:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 就像犬夜叉所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.20,0:46:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何活在这世上的人总有一天一定会死去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.17,0:46:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.10,0:46:31.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道有没有什么事是我们能帮得上忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.47,0:46:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.94,0:46:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒的师父最后宴会
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.14,0:46:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少应该准备一下送师父上黄泉路的礼物
